    "Once Dani & Rob have completed making all iOS apps accessible, they will open NSCoffee, a specialist coffee roasters sourcing beans from small farms across Colombia, Ethiopia and Sumatra. We'll roast in small batches every week to keep things fresh, and work directly with growers to make sure they're paid fairly for their harvest." : {

